### 2.4. `close_campaign_tester_bonus`
Allows the campaign owner to early-close an active round. Transitions status to `closing`, resolves pending obligations, and refunds unspent remaining escrow back to the owner's profile balance.

- **PostgREST Signature:** `POST /rest/v1/rpc/close_campaign_tester_bonus`
- **Caller Role:** Authenticated Campaign Owner only.

#### Request Parameters
| Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `p_campaign_id` | UUID | Yes | Target campaign ID. |

#### Success Response (`200 OK`)
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "round_id": "c1111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555555",
  "campaign_id": "aaaaaaaa-bbbb-cccc-dddd-eeeeeeeeeeee",
  "status": "closed",
  "paid_count": 2,
  "refunded_credits": 80,
  "refunded_at": "2026-11-11T09:00:00Z"
}
```
*Note:* If pending reports submitted prior to closing still exist, `status` becomes `"closing"`, and refund occurs immediately upon resolution of the last pending report.

